<!-- Shared button animation set, same EQLS_window_pieces slices the waypoint
     window uses. Naming and offsets follow NMS_WaypointsWnd.xml so the two custom
     windows look identical; a wrong slice here renders a blank button, so they are
     copied verbatim rather than guessed. -->
